{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pulls/5783","id":1969735303,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAU0OSs51Z8aH","html_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pull/5783","diff_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pull/5783.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pull/5783.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/5783","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pulls/5783/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pulls/5783/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/5783/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/statuses/3ba47b2563dbfe3f5a711f6331cf2fc5336b4365","number":5783,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fixed TTL expiration check to trigger file deletion on mounted points","user":{"login":"andrea-agostini","id":151916527,"node_id":"U_kgDOCQ4P7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151916527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini","html_url":"https://github.com/andrea-agostini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# What problem are we solving?\r\nhttps://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/5527\r\n\r\n# How are we solving the problem?\r\nChanging delete method calls in filer.go so that they also trigger a NotifyUpdateEvent and have a filer.remote.sync daemon simultaneously delete files on remote mounted point.\r\n\r\n# How is the PR tested?\r\n1. Start seaweed master/filer/volume docker images with patched exe, e.g.:\r\n```\r\nservices:\r\n  master:\r\n    image: chrislusf/seaweedfs:local\r\n    ports:\r\n      - \"9333:9333\"\r\n      - \"19333:19333\"\r\n    command: \"master -ip=master -ip.bind=0.0.0.0\"\r\n  volume:\r\n    image: chrislusf/seaweedfs:local\r\n    ports:\r\n      - \"8089:8080\"\r\n      - \"18089:18080\"\r\n    command: 'volume -mserver=\"master:9333\" -ip.bind=0.0.0.0 -port=8080'\r\n    depends_on:\r\n      - master\r\n  filer:\r\n    image: chrislusf/seaweedfs:local\r\n    ports:\r\n      - \"8888:8888\"\r\n      - \"18888:18888\"\r\n    command: 'filer -master=\"master:9333\" -ip.bind=0.0.0.0'\r\n    tty: true\r\n    stdin_open: true\r\n    depends_on:\r\n      - master\r\n      - volume\r\n```\r\n2. From weed shell:\r\n    -  configure S3 credentials and mount some remote S3 bucket:\r\n    ```\r\n    > remote.configure -name=ttltest -type=s3 -s3.access_key=xxxx -s3.secret_key=yyyy -s3.storage_class=STANDARD -s3.region=eu-west-1\r\n    > remote.mount -dir=/buckets/mytest -remote=ttltest/ttl-local-test\r\n   ```\r\n   - configure TTL on said bucket\r\n   ```\r\n   > fs.configure -locationPrefix=/buckets/mytest -ttl=1m -apply\r\n   ```\r\n3. Start a filer.remote.sync to sync filer updates to the bucket:\r\n ```\r\n./weed filer.remote.sync -filer=localhost:8888 -dir=/buckets/mytest\r\n```\r\n4. Upload a random file to the bucket:\r\n```\r\ncurl -F \"file=@blah.txt\" \"http://localhost:8888/buckets/mytest/blah.txt\r\n```\r\n5. Wait for configured TTL to expire and execute fs.ls command from weed shell:\r\n```\r\n>fs.ls /buckets/mytest\r\n```\r\n6. Verify that file has been removed from filer *AND ALSO* deleted on remote /ttl-local-test S3 bucket.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-07-15T15:53:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T06:35:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"andrea-agostini:5527_files_on_mounted_point_are_not_deleted_after_ttl_expires","ref":"5527_files_on_mounted_point_are_not_deleted_after_ttl_expires","repo":{"id":828998269,"node_id":"R_kgDOMWmCfQ","name":"seaweedfs","full_name":"andrea-agostini/seaweedfs","owner":{"login":"andrea-agostini","id":151916527,"node_id":"U_kgDOCQ4P7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151916527?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini","html_url":"https://github.com/andrea-agostini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-agostini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"SeaweedFS is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, files, and data lake, for billions of files! Blob store has O(1) disk seek, cloud tiering. Filer supports Cloud Drive, cross-DC active-active replication, Kubernetes, POSIX FUSE mount,